  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Leaves a drawing tool. The callers jump here and remove their return address first. When mirror_mode_saved is set, sets mirror mode again (mirror_mode_on). Runs the script at $1dd3, then goes to the menu ($0b4a)."},
    {"at":21,"placement":"line","text":"Runs the script at $1dfe. The script starts with op 9 to bitmap_mode_on. The tool start code at $0dd0 calls it."},
    {"at":29,"placement":"line","text":"Compares the ends of the line (line_x0, line_y0) and (line_x1, line_y1). C = 0 when they differ by less than 25 on both axes, else C = 1."},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"25 pixels."},
    {"at":74,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the end of the line (line_x1, line_y1) to the cursor (cursor_x, cursor_y)."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"line","text":"Runs the script at $1e7c. The code of the Erase command ($0c24) calls it."}
